# Build-context exclusions.
#
# The Dockerfile still names every directory it copies explicitly, and that is
# the guard that matters — an exclusion list fails OPEN, so anything added later
# is included unless somebody remembers to add it here. This file is about
# BUILD SPEED: without it the whole context, node_modules included, is uploaded
# to the daemon on every build.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.env
.env.*
tests
eval
sim
scripts
# ...except the migration runner, which the Cloud Run migration job needs. The
# Dockerfile names it explicitly; without this negation that COPY fails.
!scripts/migrate.js
docs
latency-runs
infra
AI-phone-dashboard
.superpowers
*.log
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
